    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. I'm wondering if the pH is specifically affecting the zeta potential of the droplets. If I increase the concentration of lecithin to compensate for the reduced repulsion, does that actually improve stability, or does it just create a more cluttered interface that might actually promote flocculation in the long run?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
