    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It sounds like we're dealing with a very fine line between stability and failure. Could you expand on the mechanism of that \"bridging\" effect you mentioned? I'm trying to visualize how the emulsifier molecules might actually facilitate the clustering of droplets rather than preventing it.",
